{"asset_key":"mn2/herohub_story_10413140","episode":"mn2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10413140","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041314001:1":{"text":"アルドンさん、占いの原理って一体なんですか？","source_cn":"雅顿贤者，占卜的原理到底是什么呀？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59877FB5AD7296FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041314002:1":{"text":"占いがわしらに与えてくれるのは、未来に対する啓示であって、結果ではない。","source_cn":"占卜给予我们的是对于未来的启示，而非结果。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76F02277C3D40B02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041314003:1":{"text":"占いというのは、既知の条件を利用して特殊な力で運命という長い川を覗き込み、未知の問題に対して最大の可能性を探るものなんじゃ。","source_cn":"占卜，就是利用已知条件，通过特殊的力量窥视命运长河，为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7494C18B19F819F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041314004:1":{"text":"あぁ……つまり、占いは数学の問題なんですね。どうりでロンロンが分からないわけです！","source_cn":"啊……原来占卜是数学问题，怪不得满满学不会！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x247C06C939FA4E93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:雅顿":{"text":"アルドン","source":"雅顿","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}